{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 1, :comments ["<b>In the first month.</b> In the fortieth year. And there is nothing in the Torah at all — no event or prophecy — except in the first year and in the fortieth year." "And the meaning of <b>the children of Israel, the whole congregation, came.</b> Because the wilderness generation had died, and now those who were to enter the land of Canaan came." "<b>And the people stayed in Kadesh.</b> Because they stayed there many days, for so it is written."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:18:26.736136032Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}